<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up fully $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up fully $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts sold fully $1.00 higher. Demand was good on moderate to light offering. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 55.00-56.50, few 57.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>		400-500 lbs. 43.00-46.00, few 47.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 45.00-48.00, few 49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
